{"reviewId": "237554720_88oV5Nu0W", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "周金涛1998年入职渤海证券，后任职长江证券，2010年加入中信建投证券组建研究团队。在熊彼特三周期基础上加入房地产周期，提出包含60年康波周期、20年房地产周期、9年投资周期和18个月库存周期的四周期嵌套理论。\n代表性著作《涛动周期论》于2017年12月27日其逝世一周年之际出版，副标题为“经济周期决定人生财富命运”，由机械工业出版社于2017年12月10日出版，ISBN为9787111583974，该书是周金涛的演讲稿、文章合集。\n《人生财富靠康波：涛动周期论》由中信于2024年12月出版\n实在是太可惜了", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "1363-1426", "abstract": "虽然经济的转型期本质上就是经济衰退，这将大大抑制股市的繁荣程度，但作为中国虚拟经济繁荣的起点，我们认为市场的活跃是可以期待的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "237554720_88oV5Nu0W", "userVid": 237554720, "topics": [], "createTime": 1776309273, "userEditTime": 1784799784, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 237554720, "name": "Flaaaaaaaaash", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-NhbHkFzMelK60ty1tUcTH10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "So it goes", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "永远真实 保持热爱", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-1000", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 213726899, "name": "glitter", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM5ib9UrW3gMOnia4g3T7mhV8iaibHfibDOxZzfpplicoB95bryA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "天津南开大学研究生毕业2016年逝世于天津。", "reviewId": "237554